inner of the race between the guard's evaluation and the test's failure writes the registry entry. The 3 survivors are the cases where the guard would have fired but the test's failure channel was faster, so the registry records the test's description. The compile.py 1/9 and the 4/4 to 6/7 banding are the race outcomes across modules with different guard latencies.","optional_refs":[],"sidecar":{"requested_context_aliases":[],"search_signal":"productive"},"typicality":0.42}],"simulation_proposals":[]}